{
 "duration": 26.29,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On their late-fall camping trip, the sun drops at five, and Leo and Sam crawl into the tent, cold and bored.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 6.992
  },
  {
   "text": "Long nights don't have to end camp.",
   "start": 7.392,
   "end": 9.037
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 9.337,
   "end": 10.264
  },
  {
   "text": "Hang a small lantern from the tent loop so camp stays lit without blinding anyone.",
   "start": 10.564,
   "end": 15.487
  },
  {
   "text": "Sit on a foam pad instead of the cold ground.",
   "start": 15.787,
   "end": 18.393
  },
  {
   "text": "Plan with a checklist so the warm layers come.",
   "start": 18.693,
   "end": 21.214
  },
  {
   "text": "Their next camp night runs past nine.",
   "start": 21.714,
   "end": 23.655
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next camping trip.",
   "start": 24.155,
   "end": 26.09
  }
 ],
